/// range of [custom functions](#awk-functions) for querying and mutating message contents
/// and metadata.
///
/// Works by feeding message contents as the program input based on a chosen
/// [codec](#codecs) and replaces the contents of each message with the result. If the
/// result is empty (nothing is printed by the program) then the original message contents
